/target
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Runtime artifact, not source. The constellation aggregation layer appends its
# mutating-request audit log here whenever CONSTELLATION_AUDIT_LOG_PATH is unset
# (src/config.rs::constellation_audit_log_path defaults to a relative path, i.e.
# the process CWD) -- which includes `cargo test`, so the crate root collects the
# auth/proxy tests' synthetic login records on every run. It was committed by
# accident and has been dirtying worktrees ever since. Nothing reads it from the
# repo: it is tail-read at runtime from the SERVICE working directory.
/constellation-audit.jsonl
